- **基准**：`milestone-0.70.4-start` tag 已于本地 tag 清理时删除，改用其目标提交 `9b97f342` 作为 diff 基准（`git diff --name-only 9b97f342`）。
- **变更文件**（10 个，不含里程碑文档/非代码）：
  - `crates/rex-sip/src/lib.rs`
  - `crates/rex-hub/src/resource_conn.rs`
  - `crates/rex-hub/src/resource_api.rs`
  - `packages/rex-console-web/src/features/resource/WizardModal.vue`
  - `packages/rex-console-web/src/features/resource/__tests__/WizardModal.sip.test.ts`
  - `packages/rex-console-web/src/features/sip/SipPage.vue`
  - `packages/rex-console-web/src/features/sip/SipPage.test.ts`
  - `packages/rex-console-web/src/features/workspace/PaneLeaf.vue`
